    "title": "Why More People Are Turning to Professional Stylists Instead of DIY Hair Color - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago More people are booking appointments with professional colorists instead of reaching for a box of hair dye at the drugstore. Box color still sells, and plenty of people get a fine result from it, especially for a simple root touch-up. But the number of clients showing up asking for a color correction after a DIY attempt keeps climbing, and stylists say it usually comes down to something a box simply can’t account for, the exact condition, tone and history of the hair in the chair. Read full article",
